{
  "kind": "floret.patch",
  "version": 2,
  "appVersion": "0.0.1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Layout Bloom",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -314
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Layout bloom\n\nLayout places `count` items in a grid, a ring, a phyllotaxis spiral or along a path, and gives each a position, an angle and a scale. When the count, the mode or a grid's `cols` changes (or you edit the node), every item eases to its new place over `duration`: new ones grow in, removed ones shrink away. `stagger` starts later items later.\n\nHere an Expression steps the count 12 → 42 → 72 → 102 every 1.8 s. Switch the mode to `grid` or `ring` and watch the seeds travel.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Layout bloom\n\nLayout places `count` items in a grid, a ring, a phyllotaxis spiral or along a path, and gives each a position, an angle and a scale. When the count, the mode or a grid's `cols` changes (or you edit the node), every item eases to its new place over `duration`: new ones grow in, removed ones shrink away. `stagger` starts later items later.\n\nHere an Expression steps the count 12 → 42 → 72 → 102 every 1.8 s. Switch the mode to `grid` or `ring` and watch the seeds travel.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lb_count",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 59
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "12 + 30 * (floor(t / 1.8) % 4)"
      },
      "portValues": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "lb_lay",
      "defType": "geometry/layout",
      "position": {
        "x": 264,
        "y": 75
      },
      "params": {
        "mode": "spiral",
        "easing": "inOutCubic"
      },
      "portValues": {
        "spacing": 17,
        "duration": 1.1,
        "stagger": 0.55,
        "easing": "inOutCubic"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lb_each",
      "defType": "region/foreach",
      "position": {
        "x": 535,
        "y": 22
      },
      "params": {
        "width": 814,
        "height": 317,
        "label": "ForEach seed"
      },
